prompt_weekly_body:
Review this Atlas over the last {days} days.

Documents changed:
{changes}

Documents untouched for 6 months or more:
{stale}

Possible contradictions:
{contradictions}

Write a short recap: what moved forward, what deserves an update, which contradictions to settle. Read the documents involved before concluding. Then offer to save it with create_doc, where AGENTS.md says.

prompt_triage_body:
Examine these possible contradictions, one pair at a time:
{candidates}

For each pair, read both documents (read_doc, at the lines given), decide whether they really conflict, then record your verdict with judge_contradiction (real or none, with a_line and b_line). End with the list of real contradictions and what should be fixed.
